---
import {getEntry} from 'astro:content';
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import PageIntro from './PageIntro.astro';
import Photo from './Photo.astro';
interface Props{id:string;}
const {id}=Astro.props;
const entry=await getEntry('services',id);
if(!entry)throw Error(`Missing service ${id}`);
const s=entry.data;
const writing=id==='keynote-writing',coaching=id==='coaching';
const title=writing?'Your story. A keynote with purpose.':coaching?'Find clarity. Develop your voice.':'Give your audience a new perspective.';
---
<Base title={title} description={s.summary}><PageIntro title={title} eyebrow={s.title.toUpperCase()} description={s.summary}/><section class="section wrap">{id==='speaking'&&<Photo kind="stage"/>}<div class="split"><div><p class="eyebrow">WHO THIS IS FOR</p><h2>{writing?'A message worth shaping.':coaching?'A voice that feels like yours.':'A human voice in the room.'}</h2><p>{s.audience}</p><a class="button" href={`/contact/?service=${id}`}>{writing?'Discuss your keynote':coaching?'Discuss coaching':'Inquire about an event'} ↗</a></div><div><p class="eyebrow">WHAT WE CAN EXPLORE</p><ul>{s.deliverables.map(d=><li>{d}</li>)}</ul></div></div></section><section class="section dark"><div class="wrap split"><div><p class="eyebrow">A PERSONAL CONVERSATION</p><h2>{writing?'From a first thought to a coherent story.':coaching?'Start where you are.':'Make space for a different perspective.'}</h2></div><div>{writing?<><p>Bring notes, an early draft or simply the occasion you’re preparing for. The first conversation explores your audience, your purpose and what you want the talk to carry.</p><p>Drafting, revisions and rehearsal are scoped together before an engagement begins.</p></>:coaching?<><p>Discuss individual coaching, focused work on a message or the format that fits your goals. Availability, cadence and the scope of support are part of that conversation.</p><p>Looking for the named program? <a href="/the-mindset-revolution/">Explore The Mindset Revolution →</a></p></>:<><p>Leadership. Resilience. Personal storytelling. Begin with your audience and the conversation you want to open.</p><p>Topic, format and takeaways are discussed in the event inquiry. Share what matters to your people.</p><a class="button gold" href="/media-kit/">Organizer resources ↗</a></>}</div></div></section><section class="section wrap"><p class="eyebrow">HOW THE CONVERSATION BEGINS</p><h2>{writing?'From discovery to delivery.':'A thoughtful first step.'}</h2><div class="steps">{s.process.map((p,i)=><article class="step"><span class="number">{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><h3>{p}</h3><p>{writing?['Clarify the occasion, audience and intention.','Find a through-line for the story.','Develop the message around that structure.','Discuss feedback and the agreed revision scope.','Explore support for bringing the words into the room.'][i]:['Tell us what you have in mind.','Discuss the goals and the kind of support that fits.','Confirm practical details before committing.'][i]}</p></article>)}</div></section><section class="section wrap"><div class="faq-group"><details id="scope"><summary>How do I discuss scope and availability?</summary><p>Use the <a href={`/contact/?service=${id}`}>{s.title.toLowerCase()} inquiry</a> and share the context. Dates, formats and deliverables are agreed directly.</p></details><details id="next-step"><summary>What should I share in my first inquiry?</summary><p>{writing?'Include the occasion, audience, talk length, deadline and any starting material.':coaching?'Tell us what you want to work on and any format preferences.':'Include the event date or say undecided, the audience, location and what you hope the session will address.'}</p></details></div></section></Base>
